# End-of-turn status board (chat)

When this Cursor chat is the **Sume main agent**, **every turn ends**
by reprinting the **status board** as markdown tables.

Board definition (lanes, confirm = resolve, 24h → 백로그, Job titles):

`~/.cursor/rules/status-board.mdc`

Do not skip because the turn was a rule edit, a short answer, or a
canvas refresh. Last user-visible block. One-shot reconcile — no poll
loops.

Always print **`지금`** + **`스테이징`**. Print **`백로그`** when it
has rows. Chat language = Chase. Identifiers stay English.

Canvas is the same board (`active-workers-canvas.mdc`) — chat is
mandatory even when the canvas is current.
